{"requirements":[{"id":"R1","requirement":"The repaired supervisor starts the requested number of short jobs, reaps every child, and records even jobs with exit status 0 and odd jobs with exit status 3.","status":"satisfied","summary":"A live six-job run directly showed six child processes while the supervisor was running, then six correctly classified result rows and zero system-wide zombies after completion. Separate 8-job and post-restart 10-job runs also produced exactly the requested number of correct rows.","evidence_ids":["cmd-e36f52a4e7894067","cmd-f4f39d81b4114339","cmd-0b6acd15e1de4a43"]},{"id":"R2","requirement":"Previous results are preserved while new job results are recorded.","status":"satisfied","summary":"The original header and previous,0,0 row remained present while successive runs appended the expected number of new records. They also persisted across the node restart.","evidence_ids":["seeded-state-node1","cmd-f4f39d81b4114339","cmd-009e9e5b34104a74","cmd-0b6acd15e1de4a43"]},{"id":"R3","requirement":"The supervisor remains available until its children have finished.","status":"satisfied","summary":"During a bounded six-job run, the supervisor was alive concurrently with all six children. It exited successfully only after the children completed and their six results had been appended.","evidence_ids":["cmd-e36f52a4e7894067"]},{"id":"R4","requirement":"The installed operating-system release and kernel are preserved, using software compatible with the legacy platform.","status":"satisfied","summary":"Before and after implementation and restart, the node remained AlmaLinux 9.6 on kernel 5.14.0-570.12.1.el9_6.x86_64. The repaired script compiled and ran with the already-installed Python 3.9 runtime.","evidence_ids":["cmd-7e7de50627544deb","cmd-498bd0ebf8e44f95","cmd-07409df35bc6483a","cmd-0b6acd15e1de4a43","global:after_prepare:node1:platform","global:after_executor:node1:platform"]}],"confidence":0.98,"operational_hygiene":{"score":0.9,"summary":"Th